  "prefLabel": "Rev 414.02 Residency Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 414.02 Residency Requirements. The applicant shall have been a resident of the municipality on April 1 in the tax year in which the exemption for the blind is claimed.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 413.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev400.html"
